B.a8B=new A.tk("About CodeBharat Pro (Coding Seekho)","CodeBharat Pro (Coding Seekho) is an interactive educational coding platform developed by Durgesh Chaturvedi in Jaunpur, Uttar Pradesh, India.\n\nOur mission is to make computer programming accessible to every student in their native language\u2014supporting Hindi, Bhojpuri, Awadhi, Maithili, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu, Bengali, English, and 40+ global languages.\n\nKey Features:\n\u2022 279+ Structured Coding Chapters across Python, HTML & CSS, Java, C++, C#, C, PHP, SQL, and Bash.\n\u2022 5 Practical Examples & 5 Real-Life Questions per Chapter.\n\u2022 Live Multi-Language Code Compiler & AI Coding Mentor.",null)
B.a8E=new A.tk("Privacy Policy","Last Updated: November 2026\n\nAt CodeBharat Pro (https://netlify.app), the privacy of our students and visitors is our top priority.\n\n1. Information We Collect: We do not require mandatory registration or collect sensitive personal financial data from students to read tutorials.\n2. Cookies & Google AdSense: Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings.\n3. AI Mentor & Live Compiler: Code snippets and questions entered into the AI Mentor or Compiler are processed solely to generate educational responses and execution outputs.\n4. Children's Privacy: Our content is strictly educational and safe for students of all ages.",null)
B.a8C=new A.tk("Terms & Conditions","By accessing and using CodeBharat Pro (https://netlify.app), you agree to the following terms:\n\n1. Educational Purpose: All tutorials, code examples, quizzes, and AI explanations are provided for learning and skill-building purposes.\n2. Fair Use of Compiler & AI: Users must not submit harmful, illegal, or malicious scripts into the online code execution terminal.\n3. Intellectual Property: All original platform design, compiled lessons, and branding belong to CodeBharat Pro (Durgesh Chaturvedi).",null)
B.a8D=new A.tk("Contact Us","Have questions, feedback, bug reports, or AdSense/business inquiries? Reach out to our team:\n\n\u2022 Founder & Lead Developer: Durgesh Chaturvedi\n\u2022 Platform Name: CodeBharat Pro (Coding Seekho)\n\u2022 Official Website: https://netlify.app\n\u2022 Location: Jaunpur, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nWe aim to respond to all student and partner queries within 24\u201348 hours.",null)
